### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wilson@teste.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Criar uma matéria (pré-requisito para a tarefa)
POST http://localhost:8080/subjects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Física",
  "description": "Mecânica e termodinâmica"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("subjectId", response.body.id);
%}

### Criar um cronograma (pré-requisito para a tarefa)
POST http://localhost:8080/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Semana de Física",
  "startDate": "2026-09-08",
  "endDate": "2026-09-14"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("scheduleId", response.body.id);
%}

### Criar uma tarefa
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subjectId": {{subjectId}},
  "scheduleId": {{scheduleId}},
  "title": "Revisar leis de Newton",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-10"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("taskId", response.body.id);
%}

### Listar tarefas de uma matéria específica
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?subjectId={{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar uma tarefa específica pelo id
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marcar a tarefa como concluída
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Confirmar que "completed" agora é true
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar a tarefa (título e data)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subjectId": {{subjectId}},
  "scheduleId": {{scheduleId}},
  "title": "Revisar leis de Newton e Kepler",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-11"
}

### Deletar a tarefa
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar tarefa sem token (deve dar 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectId": {{subjectId}},
  "scheduleId": {{scheduleId}},
  "title": "Sem token",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-10"
}

### Criar tarefa com subjectId inexistente (deve dar erro)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subjectId": 999999,
  "scheduleId": {{scheduleId}},
  "title": "Matéria inexistente",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-10"
}

### Criar tarefa sem título (deve dar 400, validação do @NotBlank)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "subjectId": {{subjectId}},
  "scheduleId": {{scheduleId}},
  "dueDate": "2026-09-10"
}
